"|PIOCORE| is written in `Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`_ and "
"works on Windows, macOS, Linux, FreeBSD and *ARM*-based credit-card sized "
"computers (`Raspberry Pi <http://www.raspberrypi.org>`_, `BeagleBone <http://"
"beagleboard.org>`_, `CubieBoard <http://cubieboard.org>`_, `Samsung ARTIK "
