#: ../../../core/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"|PIOCORE| provides a rich and documented Command Line Interface (CLI). The "
"other PlatformIO-based software and IDEs are based on **PlatformIO Core "
"CLI**, such as :ref:`pioide`. In other words, they wrap |PIOCORE| with own "
"GUI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"Please note that you do not need to install |PIOCORE| if you are going to "
"use :ref:`pioide`. |PIOCORE| is built into PlatformIO IDE and you will be "
"able to use it within PlatformIO IDE Terminal."
msgstr ""

